terms-note = Saving songs this way breaks YouTube's terms, even on a paid account, and uses this account's cookies.
youtube-music-note = Nothing is asked of YouTube until this is on, and only while Online is on. yt-dlp is a program of its own, installed apart. The cookies name a browser as yt-dlp does, as firefox or firefox:/path/to/profile for a fork such as Zen, or the path of a cookies file. With none, songs come at the free tier.
